# Tabs - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_tabs.kbd)
**tabs + spc**      -- Spc
**tabs + l**        -- Next
**tabs + h**        -- Prev
**tabs + t**        -- New
**tabs + vertical** -- Vertical Tabs
**tabs + w**        -- Close
**tabs + lsft + t** -- Undo Close
**tabs + 1**        -- Goto 1
**tabs + 2**        -- Goto 2
**tabs + 3**        -- Goto 3
**tabs + 4**        -- Goto 4
**tabs + 5**        -- Goto 5
**tabs + 6**        -- Goto 6
**tabs + 7**        -- Goto 7
**tabs + 8**        -- Goto 8
**tabs + 9**        -- Goto Last
**tabs + toggle**   -- Toggle
